{"success":true,"source":"https://api-prod.potatohead.co/api/experiences?start=2026-11-23T16%3A00%3A00.000Z&end=2027-05-24T15%3A59%3A59.999Z&type=Event&categories=music","cached":true,"timestamp":"2026-11-24T07:40:34.051Z","data":[{"id":1050,"Type":"Event","Title":"Live at Klymax: OFFSCRIPT","Excerpt":"Live at Klymax is a series exploring live performance in a club environment, bringing together musicians, electronic instruments and visual artists.","Slug":"live-at-klymax-offscript","createdAt":"2026-11-13T08:21:09.367Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-23T03:25:13.524Z","publishedAt":"2026-11-17T02:32:48.404Z","Description":"Live at Klymax is a series dedicated to live performance in its truest form. Artists take the stage with instruments, hardware, or moving images. Bringing music and visual work into the room as it happens, in real time.\n\nThis September, Klymax welcomes OFFSCRIPT, a warm, improvised live session hosted by Greybox and Kanhaiya, where the spirit of jazz flows freely through soul, house, hip-hop, broken beat and drum & bass. Equal parts club set and studio experimentation, OFFSCRIPT brings together an accomplished array of instrumentalists, vocalists, rappers, and DJs for an unscripted musical dialogue where no two moments are ever quite the same.\n\nBridging generations, genres, and communities, OFFSCRIPT creates a space where musicians and audiences can connect intuitively in the moment. It’s an experience that proves something essential: jazz isn’t just something to listen to at home. It’s still a vital force that can animate collective dancefloor expression.\n\nSince 2025, OFFSCRIPT has been bringing colour, energy and a fresh sense of musical discovery to Seminyak, with previous nights at KARAT and SEKEN. Now, the series arrives at the desa for a new chapter in our temple of sound.\n\nSaturday 5 September 2026\n\nDoors open at 9 pm. Come early, settle in, and dance until close.\n\nKlymax, Desa Potato Head Bali","sitemap_exclude":false,"HideDateStart":fa